# No LLM on the money path (ADR-0002)

Source: `docs/adr/0002-no-llm-on-money-path.md`. Read it before adding
any model call to runtime code.

Forbidden LLM use on the runtime path:

- Firewall (IDPI sanitization)
- Guardrails (merchant policy)
- Mandate verification
- Vault (identity, TTL, revocation, denylist)
- Money actions (Razorpay calls)
- Audit hashing (SHA-256 chain, ADR-0003)

All security-critical paths are deterministic code. "AI judgment" is the
Refusal. Agents are clients, not components.
